-- Sample companies for showing the site to clients (not a migration).
-- Every name ends with "(דוגמה)", every slug starts with "demo-", the company
-- page shows a notice, and these pages are left out of the sitemap and search.
-- Reviews are added as staff reviews, so they are labelled publicly.
-- Run in Supabase SQL Editor. Safe to run more than once.
-- To remove everything: supabase/demo/remove_demo_companies.sql

begin;

